---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="TELOS | Rob Chuvala — Problems, Missions, Goals" description="Rob Chuvala's TELOS — the problems he works, the missions behind them, and what shipping looks like.">
  <main class="relative z-10 pt-28 pb-20 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-gradient mb-4">TELOS</h1>
        <p class="font-body text-lg text-text-secondary">
          The problems I work, the missions behind them, and what shipping looks like. I spent two decades learning how to break into systems. Then I spent a year learning how to stop breaking myself. The second problem turned out to be harder and more interesting.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Problems -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent bg-accent/20 px-3 py-1 rounded">P</span>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-text-primary">Problems</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="font-body text-text-secondary mb-6">
          The gaps nobody else is standing in.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-bg-secondary rounded-xl border border-border-default p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent shrink-0">P0</span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-heading text-lg text-text-primary mb-2">AI output is fluent but ungrounded</h3>
                <ul class="space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-text-secondary">
                  <li>• It passes grammar checks but fails identity checks</li>
                  <li>• Nobody is building the detection layer between "grammatically correct" and "sounds like you"</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-bg-secondary rounded-xl border border-border-default p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent shrink-0">P1</span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-heading text-lg text-text-primary mb-2">Provenance is invisible to the sender</h3>
                <ul class="space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-text-secondary">
                  <li>• Consultants, executives, and professionals are sending AI-generated content under their names without realizing it carries zero provenance markers</li>
                  <li>• Their clients can tell. Their peers can tell. They can't tell.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-bg-secondary rounded-xl border border-border-default p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent shrink-0">P2</span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-heading text-lg text-text-primary mb-2">Attacks live at the language layer</h3>
                <ul class="space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-text-secondary">
                  <li>• Phishing, whale phishing, and voice clone attacks succeed because nobody scores the language itself against who the sender claims to be</li>
                  <li>• Headers and URLs get checked. The words don't.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Missions -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-brand bg-brand/20 px-3 py-1 rounded">M</span>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-text-primary">Missions</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="font-body text-text-secondary mb-6">
          One conviction, in different materials: take back the thing that was made someone else's, get it off the closed system, keep it real and yours.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-bg-secondary rounded-xl border border-border-default p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-brand shrink-0">M0</span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-heading text-lg text-text-primary mb-2">Build the things that prove you are you</h3>
                <ul class="space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-text-secondary">
                  <li>• Voice fidelity tools at the intersection of AI and human identity</li>
                  <li>• The Moser Test for AI output — does this sound like the person who claims to have written it?</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-bg-secondary rounded-xl border border-border-default p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-brand shrink-0">M1</span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-heading text-lg text-text-primary mb-2">Externalize the architecture I built inside myself</h3>
                <ul class="space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-text-secondary">
                  <li>• The substrate-first multi-agent fleet pattern, the anti-Editor disciplines, the operator-state-aware design</li>
                  <li>• Make the methodology available so others don't have to reinvent it from inside their own collapse</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-bg-secondary rounded-xl border border-border-default p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-brand shrink-0">M2</span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-heading text-lg text-text-primary mb-2">Build the healing center</h3>
                <ul class="space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-text-secondary">
                  <li>• The Return Protocol — mountain biking, horses, cold plunges, regenerative land — a place that absorbs anxiety instead of generating it</li>
                  <li>• For the ones told they were too broken to help</li>
                  <li>• The barrier to entry is need, not capital</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Goals -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-success bg-success/20 px-3 py-1 rounded">G</span>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-text-primary">Goals</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="font-body text-text-secondary mb-6">
          Specific, measurable, in flight.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-bg-secondary rounded-xl border border-border-default p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-success shrink-0">G0</span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-heading text-lg text-text-primary mb-2">Ship northwoods-pack past v0.2</h3>
                <ul class="space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-text-secondary">
                  <li>• Public PAI infrastructure, Apache 2.0</li>
                  <li>• Measurable: clean install end-to-end on the operator's own Cloudflare account — sovereignty from day 1</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-bg-secondary rounded-xl border border-border-default p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-success shrink-0">G1</span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-heading text-lg text-text-primary mb-2">Complete <em>Wasn't Ready Yet</em></h3>
                <ul class="space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-text-secondary">
                  <li>• Reading Copy to first readers; revise to publishable</li>
                  <li>• Two missing scenes only I can write</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-bg-secondary rounded-xl border border-border-default p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-success shrink-0">G7</span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-heading text-lg text-text-primary mb-2">The community-sovereignty application layer</h3>
                <ul class="space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-text-secondary">
                  <li>• Above Cloudflare's primitives: tribal nations, small cooperatives, community clinics, mutual aid networks, public-interest journalism</li>
                  <li>• "There is enough work here for a small team that does not yet exist."</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- What the work is measured by -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-text-primary mb-6">What the work is measured by</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-bg-secondary rounded-xl border border-border-default p-6">
            <h3 class="font-heading text-lg text-brand mb-2">Voice fidelity</h3>
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-text-secondary">Does it sound like the person who claims to have written it?</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-bg-secondary rounded-xl border border-border-default p-6">
            <h3 class="font-heading text-lg text-brand mb-2">Substrate</h3>
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-text-secondary">State lives in the substrate, not the agent. The substrate is the product.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-bg-secondary rounded-xl border border-border-default p-6">
            <h3 class="font-heading text-lg text-brand mb-2">Sovereignty</h3>
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-text-secondary">Your account, your data, from day 1. No shared-substrate starter on someone else's account.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-bg-secondary rounded-xl border border-border-default p-6">
            <h3 class="font-heading text-lg text-brand mb-2">Access</h3>
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-text-secondary">The barrier to entry is need, not capital.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <section class="border-t border-border-subtle pt-8">
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-text-tertiary italic mb-4">
          "I feel around in the darkness and map it out, then I architect it so you don't have to. I try to put myself in the exact headspace and design from there. Most of the time it is fun, but there are dark times for these dark problems. I encourage people to pay this all forward one day."
        </p>
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-text-tertiary italic">
          "I don't need a billion dollars. I need to solve a billion-dollar problem and then give the solution away."
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
